          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="55" fill="#ffd700" font-size="28" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Header/Footer Codes</text><rect x="60" y="100" width="980" height="280" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888"/><text x="550" y="130" fill="#1a1a2e" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Custom Footer Dialog</text><rect x="80" y="150" width="940" height="210" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1a1a2e" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="80" y="150" width="940" height="30" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="100" y="170" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12" font-family="Arial">Footer</text><g font-family="Arial"><rect x="100" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="120" y="219" fill="#ffffff" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">A</text><rect x="145" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="165" y="219" fill="#ffffff" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">#</text><rect x="190" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="210" y="219" fill="#ffffff" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">/</text><rect x="235" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="255" y="218" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">DATE</text><rect x="280" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="300" y="218" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">TIME</text><rect x="325" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="345" y="218" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">FILE</text><rect x="370" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="390" y="218" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">PATH</text><rect x="415" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="435" y="218" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">TAB</text><rect x="460" y="200" width="40" height="28" fill="#888"/><text x="480" y="218" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">IMG</text></g><text x="100" y="265" fill="#888" font-size="11" font-family="Arial">Left section</text><text x="450" y="265" fill="#888" font-size="11" font-family="Arial">Center section</text><text x="780" y="265" fill="#888" font-size="11" font-family="Arial">Right section</text><rect x="100" y="275" width="270" height="60" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888"/><text x="115" y="295" fill="#1a1a2e" font-size="11" font-family="Courier New">Phoenix Group LLC</text><text x="115" y="312" fill="#888" font-size="10" font-family="Courier New">(plain text)</text><rect x="380" y="275" width="350" height="60" fill="#ffd700" opacity="0.15" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="2"/><text x="395" y="295" fill="#1a1a2e" font-size="11" font-family="Courier New">&amp;F | &amp;A | Page &amp;P of &amp;N</text><text x="395" y="315" fill="#10b981" font-size="10" font-family="Courier New">→ Budget_Master.xlsx | Jan | Page 1 of 12</text><rect x="740" y="275" width="270" height="60" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888"/><text x="755" y="295" fill="#1a1a2e" font-size="11" font-family="Courier New">Printed &amp;D &amp;T</text><text x="755" y="315" fill="#10b981" font-size="10" font-family="Courier New">→ Printed 6/18/2026 09:42</text><rect x="60" y="400" width="980" height="380" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888"/><text x="550" y="430" fill="#1a1a2e" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">The Code Cheat Sheet</text><g font-family="Arial" font-size="13"><rect x="80" y="450" width="220" height="40" fill="#6366f1" opacity="0.15"/><text x="100" y="475" fill="#6366f1" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;P</text><text x="160" y="475" fill="#1a1a2e">Current page #</text><rect x="80" y="495" width="220" height="40" fill="#6366f1" opacity="0.15"/><text x="100" y="520" fill="#6366f1" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;N</text><text x="160" y="520" fill="#1a1a2e">Total pages</text><rect x="80" y="540" width="220" height="40" fill="#6366f1" opacity="0.15"/><text x="100" y="565" fill="#6366f1" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;D</text><text x="160" y="565" fill="#1a1a2e">Date printed</text><rect x="80" y="585" width="220" height="40" fill="#6366f1" opacity="0.15"/><text x="100" y="610" fill="#6366f1" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;T</text><text x="160" y="610" fill="#1a1a2e">Time printed</text><rect x="320" y="450" width="220" height="40" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="340" y="475" fill="#10b981" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;F</text><text x="400" y="475" fill="#1a1a2e">File name</text><rect x="320" y="495" width="220" height="40" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="340" y="520" fill="#10b981" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;A</text><text x="400" y="520" fill="#1a1a2e">Sheet (tab) name</text><rect x="320" y="540" width="220" height="40" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="340" y="565" fill="#10b981" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;Z</text><text x="400" y="565" fill="#1a1a2e">Full file path</text><rect x="320" y="585" width="220" height="40" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="340" y="610" fill="#10b981" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;Z&amp;F</text><text x="400" y="610" fill="#1a1a2e">Path + file</text><rect x="560" y="450" width="220" height="40" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.15"/><text x="580" y="475" fill="#ec4899" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;B / &amp;I</text><text x="660" y="475" fill="#1a1a2e">Bold / Italic toggle</text><rect x="560" y="495" width="220" height="40" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.15"/><text x="580" y="520" fill="#ec4899" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;U</text><text x="640" y="520" fill="#1a1a2e">Underline</text><rect x="560" y="540" width="220" height="40" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.15"/><text x="580" y="565" fill="#ec4899" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;&quot;Arial,Bold&quot;</text><text x="700" y="565" fill="#1a1a2e">Set font</text><rect x="560" y="585" width="220" height="40" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.15"/><text x="580" y="610" fill="#ec4899" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;14</text><text x="640" y="610" fill="#1a1a2e">Font size 14</text><rect x="800" y="450" width="220" height="40" fill="#f59e0b" opacity="0.15"/><text x="820" y="475" fill="#f59e0b" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;G</text><text x="880" y="475" fill="#1a1a2e">Picture (logo)</text><rect x="800" y="495" width="220" height="40" fill="#f59e0b" opacity="0.15"/><text x="820" y="520" fill="#f59e0b" font-weight="bold" font-family="Courier New">&amp;&amp;</text><text x="880" y="520" fill="#1a1a2e">Literal &amp; sign</text></g><rect x="80" y="660" width="940" height="100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="100" y="685" fill="#ffd700" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" font-family="Arial">Pro footer recipe (paste into Center section):</text><text x="100" y="715" fill="#10b981" font-size="14" font-family="Courier New">&amp;&quot;Arial,Bold&quot;&amp;F&amp;&quot;Arial,Regular&quot; — &amp;A — Page &amp;P of &amp;N — Printed &amp;D</text><text x="100" y="745" fill="#888" font-size="11" font-style="italic" font-family="Arial">Bold filename, then sheet, then page count, then print date.</text><text x="550" y="830" fill="#6366f1" font-size="14" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Group all 12 monthly tabs first → set the footer once → every tab inherits it.</text><text x="550" y="870" fill="#888" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Now any printout that lands on a desk identifies its file, tab, page, and date.</text><text x="550" y="950" fill="#ffd700" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">A signed-and-dated page is a page no one can mistake for last quarter&apos;s.</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Footer codes &P, &N, &D, &F, &A combine into headers that identify every printed page"
