        content: `Final polish in three passes. **Pass 1 — Protection.** Inputs tab stays editable. On Summary and Dashboard, Format Cells (Ctrl+1) → Protection tab → confirm cells are **Locked**, then Review → Protect Sheet (skip password for personal use). Hide the **Categories** tab. **Pass 2 — Print setup on the grouped monthly tabs.** Click Jan, Shift-click Dec to group all twelve. Page Layout → Set Print Area for **$A$1:$E$10**. Page Setup → Sheet → Rows to repeat at top: **$1:$1**. Header/Footer → Custom Footer Center: **&"Arial,Bold"&F&"Arial,Regular" — &A — Page &P of &N**. Scaling: **Fit to 1 page wide by 1 tall** (the report is small enough that this is safe). **Ungroup**. **Pass 3 — Save twice.** File → Save As → **.xlsx** (Budget_2026.xlsx) for use; then File → Save As → **.xltx** (BudgetTemplate.xltx) to **Custom Office Templates**. Next year, File → New → Personal → BudgetTemplate, change MonthStart to 2027, you're done.`,
